#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:4
msgid ""
"You can use the supported `Oracle Cloud Marketplace listing "
"<https://cloudmarketplace.oracle.com/marketplace/en_US/listing/188386963>`_"
" to install Mattermost Enterprise Edition on Oracle Cloud Infrastructure "
"(OCI) using Oracle Kubernetes Engine (OKE)."
msgstr ""
"지원되는 `Oracle Cloud Marketplace 리스팅 "
"<https://cloudmarketplace.oracle.com/marketplace/en_US/listing/188386963>`_\\ "
"을 사용하여 Oracle Kubernetes Engine(OKE)으로 Oracle Cloud "
"Infrastructure(OCI)에 OKR.BEST Enterprise Edition을 설치할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:7
msgid "Before you begin"
msgstr "시작하기 전에"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:9
msgid "Before deploying, make sure you have the following:"
msgstr "배포하기 전에 다음을 갖추고 있는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:11
msgid "**Oracle Cloud Account** with appropriate permissions"
msgstr "적절한 권한을 갖춘 **Oracle Cloud 계정**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:12
msgid ""
"**Permissions** to create/manage OKE, Compute, Networking, Database, "
"Resource Manager, and Secrets"
msgstr ""
"OKE, Compute, Networking, Database, Resource Manager, Secrets를 생성/관리할 "
"**권한**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:13
msgid "**Compartment** for deployment"
msgstr "배포를 위한 **구획(Compartment)**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:14
msgid "**Domain Name and TLS Certificate** for secure access"
msgstr "안전한 접근을 위한 **도메인 이름과 TLS 인증서**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:15
msgid "**Mattermost License Key** (Trial or Enterprise)"
msgstr "**OKR.BEST 라이선스 키**(평가판 또는 Enterprise)"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Node Capacity**: At least 2 OKE nodes for high availability when "
"deploying for 100 users or more"
msgstr ""
"**노드 용량**: 100명 이상을 위해 배포하는 경우 고가용성을 위한 최소 2개의 OKE 노드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:19
msgid "Installation steps"
msgstr "설치 단계"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:21
msgid ""
"The installation process includes deploying Mattermost and configuring "
"the necessary components."
msgstr ""
"설치 과정은 OKR.BEST를 배포하고 필요한 구성 요소를 구성하는 것을 포함합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:24
msgid "Step 1: Start from Oracle Cloud Marketplace"
msgstr "1단계: Oracle Cloud Marketplace에서 시작"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:26
msgid "Go to the Mattermost listing and select **Launch Stack**."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 리스팅으로 이동하여 **Launch Stack**\\ 을 선택합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:28
msgid "Oracle Cloud Marketplace listing for Mattermost"
msgstr "OKR.BEST용 Oracle Cloud Marketplace 리스팅"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:32
msgid "Step 2: Stack Information"
msgstr "2단계: Stack 정보"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:34
msgid ""
"On the **Create stack** page, review the information, and then set the "
"name, compartment, and Terraform version."
msgstr ""
"**Create stack** 페이지에서 정보를 검토한 다음 이름, 구획, Terraform 버전을 "
"설정합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:36
msgid "Stack information page"
msgstr "Stack 정보 페이지"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:40
msgid "Step 3: Configure Variables"
msgstr "3단계: 변수 구성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:42
msgid ""
"Set all the details for your Mattermost deployment. Each section is "
"important for a successful and secure installation."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 배포의 모든 세부 정보를 설정합니다. 각 섹션은 성공적이고 안전한 설치에 "
"중요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:45
msgid "OKE Cluster Configuration"
msgstr "OKE 클러스터 구성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:47
msgid "**Create new OKE Cluster:**"
msgstr "**새 OKE 클러스터 생성:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:49
msgid "Check this if you want to create a new Kubernetes cluster."
msgstr "새 Kubernetes 클러스터를 생성하려면 이 항목을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:50
msgid ""
"If you already have a cluster, you can uncheck and select your existing "
"one."
msgstr ""
"이미 클러스터가 있다면 선택을 해제하고 기존 클러스터를 선택할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:51
msgid "**Kubernetes Version:**"
msgstr "**Kubernetes 버전:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:53
msgid "Choose the latest stable version unless you have a specific requirement."
msgstr "특별한 요구 사항이 없다면 최신 안정 버전을 선택하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:54
msgid "**Node Pool Shape (Flex/Fixed):**"
msgstr "**노드 풀 셰이프(Flex/Fixed):**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:56
msgid ""
"Select a shape that fits your workload. For production, use at least 2 "
"OCPUs and 16GB RAM per node."
msgstr ""
"워크로드에 맞는 셰이프를 선택하세요. 운영 환경에서는 노드당 최소 2개의 OCPU와 "
"16GB RAM을 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:57
msgid "**Number of Nodes:**"
msgstr "**노드 수:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:59
msgid ""
"Minimum 2 for high availability. For testing, 1 is enough. For production"
" environments, always use at least 2 nodes and enable high availability."
msgstr ""
"고가용성을 위해 최소 2개. 테스트에는 1개로 충분합니다. 운영 환경에서는 항상 최소 "
"2개의 노드를 사용하고 고가용성을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:60
msgid "**Operating System:**"
msgstr "**운영 체제:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:62
msgid "Oracle Linux 8 is recommended for best compatibility."
msgstr "최상의 호환성을 위해 Oracle Linux 8을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:65
msgid "OKE Network Configuration"
msgstr "OKE 네트워크 구성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:67
msgid "**Worker Node Visibility:**"
msgstr "**워커 노드 표시 여부:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:69
msgid ""
"Private is more secure for production. Public is easier for testing. For "
"production environments, use private nodes and restrict access to the API"
" endpoint."
msgstr ""
"운영 환경에는 Private이 더 안전합니다. 테스트에는 Public이 더 쉽습니다. 운영 "
"환경에서는 private 노드를 사용하고 API 엔드포인트에 대한 접근을 제한하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:70
msgid "**API Endpoint Visibility:**"
msgstr "**API 엔드포인트 표시 여부:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:72
msgid ""
"Public allows you to manage the cluster from anywhere. Private is more "
"secure but requires VPN or bastion."
msgstr ""
"Public을 사용하면 어디서나 클러스터를 관리할 수 있습니다. Private은 더 안전하지만 "
"VPN이나 베스천이 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:73
msgid "**Create new Virtual Cloud Network (VCN):**"
msgstr "**새 가상 클라우드 네트워크(VCN) 생성:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:75
msgid "Check this to create a new network, or uncheck to use an existing one."
msgstr "새 네트워크를 생성하려면 이 항목을 선택하고, 기존 네트워크를 사용하려면 선택을 해제하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:76
msgid "**VCN CIDR Block:**"
msgstr "**VCN CIDR 블록:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:78
msgid ""
"Set a unique network range (e.g., ``10.20.0.0/16``). Avoid overlap with "
"other networks."
msgstr ""
"고유한 네트워크 범위(예: ``10.20.0.0/16``)를 설정하세요. 다른 네트워크와 겹치지 "
"않도록 하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:81
msgid "OKE Worker Nodes"
msgstr "OKE 워커 노드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:83
msgid "**Enable Cluster Autoscaler:**"
msgstr "**클러스터 오토스케일러 활성화:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:85
msgid "Allows the cluster to automatically add or remove nodes based on usage."
msgstr "클러스터가 사용량에 따라 노드를 자동으로 추가하거나 제거할 수 있도록 합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:86
msgid "**Initial/Min Number of Worker Nodes:**"
msgstr "**워커 노드의 초기/최소 수:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:88
msgid ""
"Set the minimum number of nodes. For high availability, use at least 2. "
"Autoscaling helps manage costs and performance automatically."
msgstr ""
"최소 노드 수를 설정하세요. 고가용성을 위해서는 최소 2개를 사용하세요. 오토스케일링은 "
"비용과 성능을 자동으로 관리하는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:89
msgid "**Node Shape:**"
msgstr "**노드 셰이프:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:91
msgid "Choose a shape (e.g., ``VM.Standard.E4.Flex``) and set OCPUs and memory."
msgstr "셰이프(예: ``VM.Standard.E4.Flex``)를 선택하고 OCPU와 메모리를 설정하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:92
msgid "**Auto Generate SSH Key:**"
msgstr "**SSH 키 자동 생성:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:94
msgid "Enable this if you do not have your own SSH key for node access."
msgstr "노드 접근을 위한 자체 SSH 키가 없다면 이 항목을 활성화하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:95
msgid "**Image OS and Version:**"
msgstr "**이미지 OS 및 버전:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:97
msgid "Oracle Linux 8 is recommended."
msgstr "Oracle Linux 8을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:100
msgid "PostgreSQL Configuration"
msgstr "PostgreSQL 구성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:102
msgid "**Admin Username:**"
msgstr "**관리자 사용자 이름:**"

