msgid "**Namespace:**"
msgstr "**네임스페이스:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:135
msgid "Default is ``mattermost``."
msgstr "기본값은 ``mattermost``\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:136
msgid "**License Key:**"
msgstr "**라이선스 키:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:138
