msgstr "OKR.BEST 라이선스를 업로드하거나 붙여넣으세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:139
msgid "**Helm Repository:**"
msgstr "**Helm 저장소:**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:141
msgid "Default is ``https://helm.mattermost.com``."
msgstr "기본값은 ``https://helm.mattermost.com``\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:144
msgid "Step 4: Review and Apply"
msgstr "4단계: 검토 및 적용"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:146
msgid ""
"Check all your settings and select **Create** to start the deployment. "
"Monitor the Resource Manager job and logs."
msgstr ""
"모든 설정을 확인하고 **Create**\\ 를 선택하여 배포를 시작합니다. Resource "
"Manager 작업과 로그를 모니터링하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:148
msgid "Resource Manager job monitor"
msgstr "Resource Manager 작업 모니터"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:152
msgid "Step 5: After Deployment"
msgstr "5단계: 배포 후"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:154
msgid ""
"When the job is finished, your OKE cluster, PostgreSQL database, and "
"Mattermost will be ready. To find the Mattermost web address, run:"
msgstr ""
"작업이 완료되면 OKE 클러스터, PostgreSQL 데이터베이스, OKR.BEST가 준비됩니다. "
"OKR.BEST 웹 주소를 찾으려면 다음을 실행하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:160
msgid ""
"Copy the address and create a DNS record for your domain. Open your "
"browser and go to your Mattermost URL."
msgstr ""
"주소를 복사하여 도메인에 대한 DNS 레코드를 생성하세요. 브라우저를 열고 OKR.BEST "
"URL로 이동하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:163
msgid "Step 6: Upgrade Mattermost"
msgstr "6단계: OKR.BEST 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:165
msgid "To upgrade your Mattermost installation:"
msgstr "OKR.BEST 설치를 업그레이드하려면:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:167
msgid "Access your OKE cluster through the Oracle Cloud Console"
msgstr "Oracle Cloud Console을 통해 OKE 클러스터에 접근합니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:168
msgid "Navigate to the Mattermost operator deployment"
msgstr "OKR.BEST operator 디플로이먼트로 이동합니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:169
msgid "Update the Mattermost version in the configuration"
msgstr "구성에서 OKR.BEST 버전을 업데이트합니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:170
msgid "Apply the changes and wait for the upgrade to complete"
msgstr "변경 사항을 적용하고 업그레이드가 완료될 때까지 기다립니다"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:174
msgid "**Tips for Success**"
msgstr "**성공을 위한 팁**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:176
msgid "Make sure you have all the permissions you need before you start."
msgstr "시작하기 전에 필요한 모든 권한을 갖추고 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:177
msgid "Use Oracle Vault to store passwords and sensitive data."
msgstr "비밀번호와 민감한 데이터를 저장하는 데 Oracle Vault를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:178
msgid "Use private nodes and secure your network for production."
msgstr "운영 환경에서는 private 노드를 사용하고 네트워크를 보호하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:179
msgid ""
"Always monitor logs from the Resource Manager and pods using ``kubectl "
"logs`` for more specific error messages."
msgstr ""
"더 구체적인 오류 메시지를 확인하려면 항상 Resource Manager와 ``kubectl logs``\\ "
"를 사용한 파드의 로그를 모니터링하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:180
msgid ""
"For more details, see the official `OCI Database with PostgreSQL "
"documentation <https://www.oracle.com/cloud/postgresql/>`_ and `OKE "
"documentation <https://docs.oracle.com/en-"
"us/iaas/Content/ContEng/Concepts/contengoverview.htm>`_."
msgstr ""
"자세한 내용은 공식 `OCI Database with PostgreSQL 문서 "
"<https://www.oracle.com/cloud/postgresql/>`_\\ 와 `OKE 문서 "
"<https://docs.oracle.com/en-"
"us/iaas/Content/ContEng/Concepts/contengoverview.htm>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:183
msgid "Common Errors and How to Avoid Them"
msgstr "일반적인 오류와 방지 방법"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:185
msgid "**Error: Kubernetes API not reachable**"
msgstr "**오류: Kubernetes API에 연결할 수 없음**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:187
msgid ""
"*Cause:* API endpoint is private and you're not connected to the VCN via "
"VPN or Bastion."
msgstr ""
"*원인:* API 엔드포인트가 private이며 VPN이나 베스천을 통해 VCN에 연결되어 있지 "
"않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:188
msgid ""
"*Solution:* Ensure you have access to the network or make the endpoint "
"public for testing."
msgstr ""
"*해결책:* 네트워크에 접근할 수 있는지 확인하거나 테스트를 위해 엔드포인트를 "
"public으로 만드세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:190
msgid "**Error: Stack creation fails with missing permissions**"
msgstr "**오류: 권한 누락으로 Stack 생성 실패**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:192
msgid "*Cause:* IAM policies are not set properly for the user or group."
msgstr "*원인:* 사용자나 그룹에 대해 IAM 정책이 올바르게 설정되지 않았습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:193
msgid ""
"*Solution:* Ensure you have permissions for Resource Manager, OKE, "
"Networking, and Secrets."
msgstr ""
"*해결책:* Resource Manager, OKE, Networking, Secrets에 대한 권한이 있는지 "
"확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:195
msgid "**Error: No ingress returned by kubectl**"
msgstr "**오류: kubectl이 ingress를 반환하지 않음**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:197
msgid "*Cause:* Mattermost Ingress might not be ready or was misconfigured."
msgstr "*원인:* OKR.BEST Ingress가 준비되지 않았거나 잘못 구성되었을 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:198
msgid ""
"*Solution:* Check with ``kubectl describe ingress`` and validate DNS, "
"TLS, and Helm values."
msgstr ""
"*해결책:* ``kubectl describe ingress``\\ 로 확인하고 DNS, TLS, Helm 값을 "
"검증하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:200
msgid "**Error: PostgreSQL password rejected**"
msgstr "**오류: PostgreSQL 비밀번호 거부됨**"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:202
msgid "*Cause:* Password not set or mismatched with Oracle Vault."
msgstr "*원인:* 비밀번호가 설정되지 않았거나 Oracle Vault와 일치하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:203
msgid "*Solution:* Re-check the password value or Vault secret used during setup."
msgstr "*해결책:* 설정 중에 사용한 비밀번호 값이나 Vault 시크릿을 다시 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:207
msgid ""
"You are responsible for Oracle Cloud Infrastructure costs for the "
"resources you create. Oracle Cloud credits cannot be used to buy a "
"Mattermost license."
msgstr ""
"생성하는 리소스에 대한 Oracle Cloud Infrastructure 비용은 사용자의 책임입니다. "
"Oracle Cloud 크레딧은 OKR.BEST 라이선스 구매에 사용할 수 없습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/kubernetes/deploy-k8s-oke.rst:209
msgid ""
"Learn more about managing your Mattermost server by visiting the "
":doc:`Administration Guide </administration-guide/administration-guide-"
"index>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`관리 가이드 </administration-guide/administration-guide-index>`\\ 를 "
"방문하여 OKR.BEST 서버 관리에 대해 자세히 알아보세요."

